Hi managers,

Thanks to all that responded, some who had exactly the same problem, and 
some who had done the install without problems.

The resolution eventually came from Oracle, who advised that the hang was 
being caused by attempting to install onto both nodes of the cluster, 
which because we were using a cluster file system, was causing a file 
access issue.

The Oracle installer gives you a screen when applying the patches to 
select one or more nodes of the cluster - selecting more than one node 
when installing the updated installer, and subsequent patches, appeared 
to break things.

Cheers,

Rob


