My original question was whether there was a required hardware revision
level on an hsg80 in order to run Tru64 cluster.

The answers were not conclusive but were helpful.

Depending on serial number there is a requirement for ACS software 8.6.
this minimum hardware revision level is usually E09.

HPAQ supports requires your ACS to be pretty much up to date before they
will accept the controllers for hardware support.   The current level is 8.7
patch 2.

