Good Afternoon,

We're connecting our tru64 alpha es40s to an IBM Shark SAN.

After finally getting the HBA cards working, visible, and logged into the
SAN, and the LUN defined on the SAN, we must now reboot the es40 for it to
"see" the san's disk drive.  A tape drive is also configured for the SAN.
